// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P285525697" "You cleared out the Clockwork's headquarters, preventing further danger to Steel Canyon's power grid."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskBegin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3455984354" "Positron whipped this scanner up quickly, but it should help us find the Clockwork."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1160560032" "I really owe you one for clearing up the trouble in Steel Canyon for me. With heroes like you around, the Clockwork will never find a way to steal Steel Canyon's power."
// RandomFameString :
"P59254832" "The Clockwork King had better get ready for {TaskForceName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2377025641" "The Clockwork King sure wanted to get his hands on Steel Canyon's power. It seems clear that his base of operations has got to be either there, or in one of the nearby city zones. It's only a matter of time before we find him."
// RandomFameString :
"P2106340916" "Look out, Clockwork King, it's {TaskForceName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2170567930" "That last Clockwork scheme was scary, {TaskForceName}. If you guys hadn't stopped them, the Clockwork would have rerouted all Steel Canyon's power to their own base! We can't let these activities continue. I think it's time to track down the Clockwork King.<br><br>I've made a number of sweeps across Paragon City with a scanner that Positron made, and I think I have the possible locations narrowed down to Steel Canyon and Boomtown. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to run a patrol in Steel Canyon.</A> See if you can dig up any leads on the Clockwork King's hideout."
// AcceptString :
"P1829430962" "Run a patrol in Steel Canyon"
// SendOffString :
"P1241621665" "We need a new lead; I am beginning to suspect the King has found a way to shield himself against Positron's scans."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound5_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3928150173" "Patrol, seek King's hideout"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3335459530" "Have you finished that patrol yet? I was really hoping you'd find the Clockwork King's hideout!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P225302983" "Nothing on the patrol, eh? Well, that's all right. We'll find the Clockwork King's hideout, never fear.<br><br>In fact, I think I may have a lead. A big Clockwork called Bertha was spotted going into an abandoned office not too far away. Check it out. "
// RandomFameString :
"P498586590" "It seems Synapse has {TaskForceName} running his patrols for the moment. Those are some big boots to fill."

