"P1403538414" "Not to be outdone, Positron made a new toy for you. He calls it a Clockwork Immobilizer, and it will stun one Clockwork enemy for a short time. Give it a spin."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1891205408" "This Clockwork piece you found looks very distinctive. I bet we can trace it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3931242309" "I will do a quick search and find out where this Clockwork part came from. Maybe it can lead us to the King himself."

